	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: POWER STAGE\n* Qhigh + Qlow + shunt + 2-3x 4.7 uF + 100 nF commutation loop, components on L1 with the GND return on L2 directly underneath.\n* SPx/SNx: Kelvin traces from the inner shunt pad edges, routed as pairs to U4.\n* VBUS, PHASE and GND as wide pours, several vias per amp; thermal vias under Q tabs; RT1 next FET.\n* J10 pads are sized for 2.5 mm2 wire."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 98.92 -88.9 0)
		(size 150 27.94)
		(margins 2.25 2.25 2.25 2.25)
		(stroke
			(width 1.5)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 255 1)
